<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Zanaki Ephesians</book>
  <para style="h">Abhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Abhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Abhaefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Enyaarubha ya Pauro ku Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="mt2">Enyaarubha ya Pauro ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhaefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Obhutaangiro</para>
  <para style="ip">Enyaarubha yino ya Pauro kubheega bha Yeesu bho omugye gwa Efeso, akakaama hano yaari mukibhoho. Omugye gwa Efeso gwaari ni gumwe gwe emigye emikuru gyo Obhukaangati bhwa Abharooma. Efeso nigwe gwaari obhweemero bhwo obhusuruzya no obhuniibhi, kweeki kwaari na Abhayahudi bhaaru. Pauro akagya eyo eriibhaga ryo orugeendo rwaaye rwa kabhiri na rwa katatu rwo okugya kuraarika Amangʼana Amazomu iguru wa Yeesu (<char style="xt">rora <ref loc="ACT 18:19-22">Amahokya ga Abheega 18:19-22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 19:1-41">19:1-41</ref></char>) na akiikara kwe eriibhaga rye emyaaka ebhiri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Enyaarubha yino erakeerenerya amiiseego ga Taatabhugya go okubhatuurya abhaatu. Pauro arabhahiitya kubha Yeesu akakwa kumusaraba okubha atutuurye, nawe Taatabhugya yamuryooriri, na bhoono ari hamwe na Taatabhugya ahagiro ho obhusuuku obhukuru, eno arakaangata bhoono ego na naabhe kirakeego.</para>
  <para style="ip">Munyaarubha yino maanga kabhiri Pauro arasabhira abhiikirirya abharikyaaye Efeso eyo. Aramukumya Taatabhugya kwiiguru yo obhwiikirirya bhwaabhu no obhuseegi bhwaabhu, neewe arasabha Taatabhugya abhasakirye bhamenye obhuturo bhwa Taatabhugya kyeego bhuri bhwo okuruguurya no obhuseegi bhwa Yeesu bhuno bhutana ekireengo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Engʼana ya Abhakrisito bhoosi kubha kigiro kimwe na Yeesu ni kikuru bhukongʼu munyaarubha yino, naabhe riragaambwa maanga miroongo ebhiri. Pauro arabhabhuurira Abhaefeso kubha abhaatu bhano bhabhweeni obhwiikari bhuhya bhareenderwa kukora amahokya mahya. Kyaamwe Pauro areegya abhasubhe na abhakari bhaabhu, abhiibhuri na abhaana, na abhagya na abhiiragaanzi kwiikara bhuzomu kyeego abhiikirirya bhya Yeesu bhakweenderwa kwiikara. Mubhuteero, areegya kwiiguru ye ebhigwaato bhye eriihi rya mukoro.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Obhukeerya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Enyaarubha yino nikaamiri enye Pauro, nikabhirikirwa kubha omweega wa Krisito Yeesu kwo obhuseegi bhwa Taatabhugya. Nirabhakaamira emwe abhahoreeru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Abhahoreeru</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora engʼana yino mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> bhano mukwiikara mumugye [gwa Efeso], emwe abhaheene abharikyeetu kwo okugwaatana na Krisito Yeesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Orubhaango no omureembe okurwa ku Taatabhugya Taata weetu, na ku Mukuru Yeesu Krisito, bhibhe neemwe.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Enzira ya Taatabhugya okutuurya abhaatu okuhitira ku Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Akumibhwe Taatabhugya, Taata wo Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito, kwo okubha kwo okugwaatana kweetwe na Krisito, atutweereeri ebhite kwo okutuhaana orubhaango runo rukureka mukyaaro kino kitakurorekana. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Hano Taatabhugya yaari akyaari kuteema ekyaaro, akatusora tubhe abhaaye kwo okugwaatana na Krisito. Akakora ego, okubha tubhe abhahoreeru bhano tutana masoro embere waaye. Kwe ekigirirye kyo obhuseegi bhwaaye, <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Taatabhugya yaari yeendiri kweemera ekare, atukore tubhe abhaana bhaaye kwe enzira ya Yeesu Krisito. Akakora ego, kwo okuseega kwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Kweego tukumye obhuguungo bhwo orubhaango rwaaye rwo okuruguurya, bhuno akatuhaana kuhitira Omwaana waaye<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Omwaana waaye</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora </char><char style="it">Omwaana wa Taatabhugya</char> mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</note> omuseegwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Taatabhugya atutuurirye kwe enzira ya amanyiinga ga Yeesu, okubha atwaabhiiri ebhibhi bhyeetu bhyoosi, kuriingʼaana no obhwaaru bhwo orubhaango rwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Akatwaaruhirya orubhaango rwaaru na amangʼeeni goosi no obhumenyeekererya. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Taatabhugya akatuzweenia amiiseego ge embiso yaaye, yino akeenda okweerekya kuhitira ku Krisito. Akakora ego, kwo okuseega kwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Amiiseego gaaye ni kubha, hano eriibhaga rino yiiseegeeri riraahike, arareeta ebhigiro bhyoosi hamwe, bhya mwiisaaro na mukyaaro kubhukaangati bhwa Krisito.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Taatabhugya atusoriri etwe Abhayahudi kuhitira Krisito tubhone obhutuurya. Akakora amangʼana gayo kuriingʼaana no obhuseegi bhwaaye, kyeego akeenda kweema ekare. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Etwe Abhayahudi twaakaangatiri okumwiisiga Krisito, kweego tumukumye no okumuguungya Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Neemwe mwoosi abhaatu bhano mutari Abhayahudi mumariri kwiigwa engʼana ye eheene, nigo Amangʼana Amazomu gano gakubhareetera obhutuurya. Kweeki mumariri kumwiikirirya Krisito, no okubhaaswa orubhaaso kwo okuhaanwa Ekoro Muhoreeru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ekoro Muhoreeru</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora amangʼana gano mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> wuno mwaari murageenwe. Kwo okukora ego, akeerekya kubha, emwe mwoosi ni bhaatu bhaaye. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Ekoro Muhoreeru wuyo, ni kyo omwiimeerereri wo okubhona goosi garya Taatabhugya akabharagania abhaatu bhaaye. Engʼana yino eratukumiirirya kubha Taatabhugya arabhatuurya bhukongʼu abhaaye bhoosi. Kweego tukumye obhuguungo bhwaaye.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhwiisasaami bhwa Pauro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Nirabhuga, “Ozomirye, Taatabhugya,” kwe ekigirirye kiyo, kweema nikabhona amangʼana go okumwiikirirya kweenyu Omukuru Yeesu, no okuseega abhaatu abhahoreeru bhoosi. <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Nitakutiga okubhuga, “Ozomirye, Taatabhugya,” kwiiguru weenyu, na nirabhahiita kumasabhi gaane. <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>Niramusabha Taatabhugya wo Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito, Taata wo obhuguungo, abhahe emwe ekoro ya amangʼeeni ga Taatabhugya na yo obhukuundukuro bhwo okumumenya ewe. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Kweeki niramusabha akuundukure eziikoro zyeenyu ziture okurora obhweero, okubha mumenye obhwiisige bhwo okubhirikirwa kweenyu ku Taatabhugya. Na mumenye obhuniibhi bhwo obhuguungo bhwo obhugabhi bhwaaye kyeego bhuri kubhahoreeru. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Ndasabha mumenye obhunagya bhwaaye obhukuru kyeego bhuri kweetwe abhiikirirya. Obhunagya bhuyo, bhurakora emirimo muusi weetu kwe eziinguru zyo obhuturo bhwaaye, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>bhuno akakora ku Krisito hano yamuryooriri mubhaku, akamutuura murubhaara rwaaye rwo obhuryo mubhuguungo bhwaaye mukyaaro kino kitakurorekana. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Kweego, Krisito niwe ari iguru bhukongʼu kukira obhutemi bhwoosi, obhunagya, amanaga no obhukaangati, na amariina goosi gano gagaambirwe mukyaaro muno, ne ekyaaro kino kikuuza. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Taatabhugya akabhituura ebhigiro bhyoosi haasi wo obhukaangati bhwa Krisito, akamutuura abhe omukaangati iguru wa bhyoosi kwiiguru we ekanisa. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Ekanisa niyo omubhiri gwa Krisito, no obhukuunaanio bhwaaye, ewe niwe akukuunaania goosi kubhigiro bhyoosi.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Taatabhugya atutuurirye kwo orubhaango rwaaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Emwe mwaari mukuuri mumitima gyeenyu, kwe ekigirirye kyo obhusarya ne ebhibhi bhyeenyu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Kwiibhaga riyo, mwaari murakora amangʼana amabhi ge ekyaaro kino. Mukabha muratuniirira Seetaani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Seetaani</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora engʼana yino mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</char></note> omukaangati wo obhunagya bhwa amasaambwa ga kwiisaaro, wuno akubhabhaaha abhaatu bhano bhatakumwiigwa Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Etwe twoosi twaari kyeego ebho, tukiikara kwo okutuniirira enaamba embi ye emibhiri gyeetu, na amangʼeeni geetu. Tukiibhurwa no obhubhi bhwa simuka kya abhaandi, kweego Taatabhugya yaari atutiindiiri na tukeenderwa kutemwa.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Nawe, Taatabhugya ni we ebhigoongi bhyaaru, akatuseega kwo obhuseegi bhwaaye obhukuru bhuno bhutana ekireengo. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Yiingabha etwe twaari abhaku kwe ekigirirye kyo obhubhi bhweetu, akatukora kubha bhahoru hamwe na Krisito, okubha tutuuriibhwe kwo orubhaango rwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Taatabhugya akaturyoora hamwe na Krisito okurwa mubhaku, akatwiikarya hamwe neewe tukaangate na Krisito Yeesu mukyaaro kino kitakurorekana. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Taatabhugya akakora ego, okubha yeerekye eriibhaga rino rikuuza, obhuzomu bhwaaye no obhwaaru bhwo orubhaango rwaaye kweetwe kuhitira ku Krisito Yeesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Taatabhugya akabhatuurya kwo orubhaango rwaaye, kwo okubha mumwiikiriirye Yeesu Krisito, nawe bhutatuukiri kwo obhuhokya bhweenyu bhwo omukya gweenyu, ni kwo obhuturo bhwa Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Naabhe obhutuurya bhweenyu bhutakutuukana na amahokya geenyu amazomu, kweego omuutu wowoosi ataaza kwiizuungya. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Taatabhugya niwe akatubhuumba etwe, na akatubhuumba bhuhya kwo okugwaatana na Krisito Yeesu, okubha tukore amahokya amazomu, gano okurwa obhweemero Taatabhugya akagakora tugeenderere kugakora.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Obhumwe kwe enzira ya Yeesu Krisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Kweego, emwe kwe esimuka ni bhaatu bhano mutari Abhayahudi, na Abhayahudi bharabhabhirikira abhariisya. Nawe ebho bhariibhirikira bhano bhasaarirwe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bhasaarirwe</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora </char><char style="it">okusaarwa</char> mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</note> obhusaari bhwo omubhiri bhuno bhurakorwa kwa amabhoko ga abhaatu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Muhiite ekare harya mwaari mutamumenyiri Krisito, mutaari hamwe na abhaatu bha Iziraeri, kweeki mwaari abhagini bhano mutaari bha amaragano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Amaragano</char><char style="ft" closed="false">. Rora </char><char style="it">eriiragano</char> mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</note> go obhurage bhwaabhu. Mwaari mutana obhwiisige mukyaaro muno na mwaari mutamumenyiri Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Nawe, kwo okugwaatana na Krisito Yeesu emwe bhano ekare hayo mwaari kure na Taatabhugya, bhoono mwiisukiri haguhi kwe enzira ya amanyiinga ga Krisito.<verse eid="EPH 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Krisito ewe omweene niwe omureembe gweetu, wuno yakoriri Abhayahudi na abhaatu bhe ebhyaaro ebhiindi kubha abhamwe, akaruusya obhubhisa bhuno bhwaari kyo orugito rwa gati runo rwaari kututwaanikania. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Woosi akakora ego, kwo okuruusyaho emigiro no obhuswaagyo bhwa Taatabhugya. Akakora omureembe gati wa Abhayahudi na bhano bhatari Abhayahudi okubha abhabhiri bhayo bhabhe omuutu owumwe omuhya, muusi wo omutima gwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Krisito akaruusya obhubhisa bhweetu kwo okuhitira oruku rwaaye kumusaraba. Akiigwaania amahizo abhiri gayo, kubha wumwe no okutugwaatania na Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Ambe, Krisito akaaza kurwaaza Amangʼana Amazomu go omureembe kweemwe bhano mutari Abhayahudi bhano mwaari kure na Taatabhugya, neetwe Abhayahudi bhano twaari haguhi neewe. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Kweego, kwo okuhitira Yeesu, etwe twoosi turanagya okumwiisukiirira Taata kwe Ekoro Muhoreeru.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Ambe, okurwa bhoono emwe mutari abhagini naabhe abhahiti, nawe emwe mubheeri abhiikari hamwe na abhahoreeru, ni bhaana bha Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Emwe mubheeri kyeego enyuumba yino yoombokirwe iguru wo obhurusa bhwa abheega na abharooti, neewe Krisito Yeesu omweene niwe eriigina eriikuru ryo obhurusa bhuyo. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Kweego, Krisito Yeesu ararigwaatania bhuzomu eriikiindaasi ryoosi, okubha ribhe eriiseengerero eriihoreeru ku Mukuru. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Kwo okuhitira Krisito emwe mugwaataniibhwe hamwe na abhaatu bhoosi bhano bhatari Abhayahudi no okubha emenyo ya Taatabhugya, kwe enzira ye Ekoro Muhoreeru.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Pauro ararwaaza kubhano bhatari Abhayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Kweego, enye Pauro wuno nibhohirwe kwe ekigirirye kyo okukora emirimo gya Krisito Yeesu, kweemwe bhano mutari Abhayahudi, nirabhasabhira. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Kwe eheene mumariri kwiigwa iguru we emirimo gino Taatabhugya aniheeri orubhaango rwaaye nibharaarikire emwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Taatabhugya omweene akaanikuundukurira embiso yaaye, kyeego niari nibhakaamiiri iguru wa amangʼana masuuhu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Kwo okusoma gayo, muranagya okumenya kyeego nimenyiri embiso ya Taatabhugya iguru wa Krisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ekare hayo, Taatabhugya yaari ataabhakuundukuriiri abhaatu bhe eziinyiibhuro zyoosi, kyeego abhakuundukuriiri abheega na abharooti bhaaye abhahoreeru kwe enzira ye Ekoro Muhoreeru. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Embiso eyeene ni yino, kwe enzira yo okugiikirirya Amangʼana Amazomu, abhaatu bhano bhatari Abhayahudi nibho abhagabhi hamwe na Abhayahudi, ebhiimo bhyo omubhiri gumwe na bhiisaangye hamwe no obhurage bhwaaye kwe enzira ya Krisito Yeesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Taatabhugya akaanikora kubha omuhokya wo okuraarika Amangʼana Amazomu, okutuukana ne esaambo yo orubhaango rwaaye. Akaaniha esaambo yiyo kwo obhunagya bhwaaye obhukuru. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Yiingabha enye ni musuuhu kukira kubhahoreeru bhoosi, nawe Taatabhugya akaaniha orubhaango runo, nibharwaazire abhaatu bhano bhatari Abhayahudi obhuniibhi bhwaaru bhwo orubhaango rwa Amangʼana Amazomu gano gakubhoneka ku Krisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Kweeki, akaaniha emirimo gyo okubhabhuurira abhaatu bhoosi, bhamenye amangʼana ge embiso yaaye yino yaari ebhisirwe kweema obhweemero, na Taatabhugya, Omubhuumbi we ebhigiro bhyoosi. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Bhoono, kwe enzira ye ekanisa, amangʼeeni goosi ga Taatabhugya gabhone kumenyekana kubhakaangati bha mukyaaro kino kitakurorekana. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Gayo goosi, Taatabhugya akakora ego kwe ekigirirye kya amiiseego gaaye ga kirakeego, kwo okuhitira Krisito Yeesu Omukuru weetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Kwo okuhitira ku Krisito, kwo okubha turamwiikirirya no okugwaatana neewe, tuno obhunagya bhwo okumwiisukiirira Taatabhugya kwo obhukaari, na tutana bhwoobha. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Kweego, nirabhasabha mutakwa emitima kwe ekigirirye kye enyaako yaane kwiiguru weenyu, gayo ni kwo obhuguungo bhweenyu.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amasabhi ga Pauro kubhiikirirya bha Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Gayo nigo gakugirya niramwiihigamira no okumusabha Taata. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Ewe niwe Omuteemi we esimuka ye ebhigiro bhyoosi bhya mwiisaaro na mukyaaro. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Niramusabha Taatabhugya wo obhuguungo bhwaaru, abhahe eziinguru muziikoro zyeenyu kwe enzira ye Ekoro yaaye mugumire, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>okubha Krisito yiikare muziikoro zyeenyu kwo obhwiikirirya. Niramusabha mubhone kubha eriitina no obhurusa bhwo obhuseegi. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>Nirasabheego kubha, mubhone okumenya hamwe na abhahoreeru bhoosi, kyeego bhuri obhuseegi bhwa Krisito kwo obhugari no obhutaambi, no okugya iguru na koongoriko. <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>Nirasabha mumenye kubha, obhuseegi bhwa Krisito kyeego bhwaaruhiri, bhuno bhukuhita obhumenyeekererya bhwa abhaatu. Nirasabheego okubha eteemo yeenyu etuubhane na Taatabhugya omweene.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Ambe, tumuguungye Taatabhugya, ewe aranagya okukora amangʼana ge ekiruguuro bhukongʼu, kukira goosi gano tukusabha kasi tukwiiseega. Ewe arakora kuriingʼaana no obhunagya bhuno bhukukora emirimo muusi weetu. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Kweego, Taatabhugya aguungibhwe mumakanisa na mu Krisito Yeesu, kuziinyiibhuro zyoosi, kirakeego na kirakeego. Gabhe ego.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Obhumwe bhwa abhiikirirya mu Krisito Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Ambe, enye omubhohwa kwiiguru yo okukora emirimo gyo Omukuru Yeesu, nirabhatoongera mwiikare mubhwiikari bhuno bhukweenderwa mumbirikiriro yino mukabhirikirirwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Eriibhaga ryoosi mubhe abhasuuku, abhanyoohu, mwiikongʼeereranie no okwiigegerana mubhuseegi. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Mukore omukya no okugeenderera no obhumwe bhuno bhukureetwa ne Ekoro Muhoreeru kwe enzira yo okwiikara kwo omureembe. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Etwe bhoosi ni mubhiri gumwe, na tukasuungʼaana Ekoro Muhoreeru, kyeego Taatabhugya yatubhirikiiri mubhwiisige bhumwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Kweeki tuno Omukuru wumwe, obhwiikirirya bhumwe no obhubatiizo bhumwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Twoosi turamuseengera Taatabhugya wumwe, niwe Taata weetu twoosi. Ewe ari iguru wa bhyoosi, arahokya emirimo kuhitira kweetwe twoosi na ariikara muusi weetu twoosi.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Nawe, etwe twoosi tuheerwe orubhaango kwe ekireengo kyaaye omweene kwo obhuturo bhwa Krisito. Akasoondya obhuturo bhuyo kyeego omweene akeenda. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Nikyo Amakaamo Amahoreeru gakubhuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Hano yagegirwe iguru mwiisaaro,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akagwaata abhabhisa bhaaye akagya nabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">akabhaha abhaatu obhuturo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="PSA 68:18">Zaburi 68:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Ambe, eriingʼana riyo, “Akagegwa iguru,” obhugazuro bhwaku niki? Obhugazuro bhwaku ni kubhuga, hano Krisito yaari akyaari kugegwa iguru akataanga okwiituuma tee mukyaaro? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Yeesu niwe akiituuma mukyaaro hano, niwe akagya kuhita amasaaro goosi, okubha yiizure mukyaaro kyoosi.<verse eid="EPH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Ewe niwe akatuura abhaandi kubha abheega, na abhaandi kubha abharooti na abhaandi abharwaazi bha Amangʼana Amazomu, na abhaandi kubha abhariisya na abheegya. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Akakora ego, okubha abhone okubhanura abhaatu abhahoreeru okukora emirimo gya Krisito, okubha omubhiri gwa Krisito guzaame. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Engʼana yiyo, erageenderera tee hano etwe turaabhe abhamwe mubhwiikirirya bhweetu, no okumumenya Omwaana wa Taatabhugya. Turabha abhaatu bhano bhakongʼiri kya Krisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Ambe, tutakunagya kubha kya abhaana abharere, turataaswataaswa eno ne eyo no okugegwa no obhukama bhwa ameegyo go omukoonyo gwa abhaatu, kwo orurimi rwaabhu, kwo okutuniirira ameegyo go orurimi. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Nawe, tubhe turiibhuurira obhuheene kubhuseegi, tubhe tugumiiri mumangʼana goosi, naabhe turiingʼaane na Krisito. Ewe niwe omukaangati iguru wa bhyoosi no omutwe gwa abhiikirirya. <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Ewe aragwaatania abhaatu bhaaye bhoosi no okubha abhamwe, na arabhigwaatania hamwe kye ebhiimo bhyo omubhiri. Na ebhiimo bhyoosi hano bhikukora emirimo gyaku bhwaheene, omubhiri gwoosi gurakiina no okubha muzomu kwo obhuseegi.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mubhe abhaatu abhahya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Kweego kwo obhuturo bhuno Omukuru Yeesu akaaniha, nirabhatoongera kubha, okweemera bhoono mutiikara kya abhaatu bhano bhatamumenyiri Taatabhugya kyeego bhakwiikara, kwo obhubhi bhwa amiiseego gaabhu. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Abhaatu bhayo, obhwoongo bhwaabhu bhuri mukiirima, na bhaahwiirwe kure no obhuhoru bhwa Taatabhugya, kwiiguru yo obhugeege bhwaabhu no obhukongʼu bhwe eziikoro zyaabhu. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Kweego bhatakurora soni, bhariisikirya mumakire, no okuseega kukora amangʼana amabhiihu gano gatakweenderwa.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Nawe emwe, muteegiibhwe ego Amangʼana gayo ga Krisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>Nino obhuheene kubha, mukiigwa amangʼana ga Yeesu no okweegibhwa amangʼana ge eheene kwiiguru waaye. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Mukeegibhwa kubha, mutige eziiteemo zyeenyu zye ekare. Eriibhaga rirya mwaari murasarika kwo okukaangiriribhwa ne eziinaamba zyeenyu. <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Na mukeegibhwa kubha, mukorwe bhuhya muziikoro na mumiiseego geenyu, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>mubhe abhaatu abhahya bhano muteemirwe kwe etuubho ya Taatabhugya, mubhe murakora ge eheene na mugaambe obhuheene no obhuhoreeru.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Kweego mutige orurimi, nawe mugaambe eheene kumuutu wuyo woosi, kwo okubha turi bhiimo bhyo omubhiri gumwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Hano mukutiinda, mutakora ebhibhi, naabhe mutiikara no obhururu tee hano eryoobha rikutubhira, <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>naabhe mutamuha Seetaani omweeya. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Omwiibhi atiibha kweeki, nawe omuutu we eteemwa yiyo ereenderwa akore emirimo emizomu kwa amabhoko gaaye, abhone ekigiro kyo okumusoondera wuno ataanakyo. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Amangʼana amabhi gatarwa muminwa gyeenyu, nawe gabhe mazomu kwiiguru yo okubhasakirya abhaandi, kuriingʼaana no obhweendi bhwaabhu. Kweego, bhano bhakubhiigwa gabhasakirye. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Mutamukorera Ekoro Muhoreeru wa Taatabhugya ebhigoongi, wuno emwe mukabhaaswa orubhaaso kwiiguru yo orusiku rwo obhutuurya. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Muruusye obhutiindi, obhururu, obhuhaari, eriiyoge, amatuki ne eziiteemwa eziimbi zyoosi. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Mubhe murakorerana bhuzomu, mubhe ne ebhigoongi, na mwaabhirane kyeego Taatabhugya abhaabhiiri emwe kwe enzira ya Krisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Okwiikara obhwiikari bhuno Taatabhugya akweenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Kweego, mutuniirire eteemwa ya Taatabhugya, kwo okubha emwe ni bhaana bha Taatabhugya bhano museegirwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Mwiikare obhwiikari bhwo obhuseegi, kyeego Krisito akatuseega etwe, akiiruusya kwiiguru weetu kubha ekimweeso kyo obhuraangaasiro bhwo omuruumbaaso ku Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Nawe, mutige obhuseebheeti gati weenyu kimwe, naabhe amakire gogoosi ne enaamba ye ebhigiro, kwo okubha amangʼana gayo gatakweenderwa mubhamwe bha abhahoreeru. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Na hatabhaho amakeerenio amabhiihu ge eziisoni, kasi amangʼana ge ekizabhuri ne ekizebhe, gayo gatakweenderwa, nawe mugaambe amangʼana go okuzomya ku Taatabhugya. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Omuutu we enaamba embi, ni kyo omuutu wuno akuseengera emisaambwa. Mumenye kubha, omuseebheeti no omwiimani na we enaamba embi, bhayo bhatakugabha kyokyoosi mubhutemi bhwa Krisito na Taatabhugya.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Obhutemi bhwa Krisito na Taatabhugya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ni hagiro hayo hoosi hano Taatabhugya niwe omukaangati. Rora </char><char style="it">obhutemi bhwa Taatabhugya</char> mu Bhugaruri bhwa Amangʼana Amakongʼu.</note> <verse eid="EPH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Omuutu wowoosi atabhakaangirirya kwa amangʼana gano gatana bhweera, Taatabhugya arabhatema kwe ekigirirye kya bhano bhatakumwiigwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Kweego, mutagwaatana na abhaatu bhayo kumangʼana gano bhakukora.<verse eid="EPH 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Ekare hayo, emwe mwaari mukiirima, nawe bhoono muri mubhweero kwo okugwaatana no Omukuru Yeesu. Kweego, mwiikare kya abhaatu bho obhweero. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Hano omuutu akwiikara mubhweero arakora obhuzomu bhwoosi kuheene no obhuheene. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Kweego, mubhe no omukya okukora gano gakumuzomera Omukuru. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Mutagwaatana okukora amangʼana gano gatakweenderwa ge ekiirima, nawe mugaange mubhweero. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Amangʼana gano gakukorwa na abhaatu abhabhi kwo obhwiibhisi ni ge eziisoni naabhe no okugagaamba. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Nawe kyokyoosi kino kituurirwe mubhweero eheene abhaatu bharakirora kyeego kiri, <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>kwo okubha obhweero nibhwe bhukukora ebhigiro bhyoosi bhirorekane. Kino nikyo ekigirirye kirabhuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Bhuuka, awe wuno ohiindiiri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">oryooke orwe mubhaku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Krisito woosi arakubharira.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Kweego, mwiiriihe mubhwiikari bhweenyu, mutiikara kya abhaatu bhano bhatana amangʼeeni, nawe kya bhano bhana amangʼeeni. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Mutabhurya eriibhaga, kwo okubha eriibhaga rino niryo obhubhi. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Kweego, mutabha abhageege, nawe mumenye obhuseegi bhwo Omukuru bhuribhwi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Kweeki mutagwaatwa, kwo okubha mubhunywi bhurimu obhubhiihu, nawe mubhe mwiizuriibhwe ne Ekoro Muhoreeru. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Mubhe mureemba ezaburi na ameembo go okumukumya Taatabhugya, eno muramweembera no okumusaambaarukira Omukuru muziikoro zyeenyu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Mubhe muramubhuurira, “Ozomirye, Taata Taatabhugya,” eziisiku zyoosi, kwo okuhitira eriina ryo Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo kubhasubhe na abhakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Musuukane emwe kwa abheene kwo okubha muramusuuka Krisito Yeesu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Emwe abhakari, mubhe murabhiigwa abhasubhe bheenyu kyeego mukumwiigwa Omukuru Yeesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Mureenderwa mukore ego, kwo okubha omusubhe ano obhukaangati iguru wa mukaaye, kyeego Krisito woosi niwe omukaangati iguru wa bhyoosi kwiiguru we ekanisa, neeryo ni mubhiri gwaaye, neewe Krisito ni Mutuurya wo omubhiri. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Ambe, kyeego ekanisa ekumwiigwa Krisito, ego neego na abhakari nabho ereenderwa bhabhiigwe abhasubhe bhaabhu kwa ngʼana yoyoosi.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Emwe abhasubhe, mubhaseege abhakari bheenyu, kyeego Krisito akayiseega ekanisa, akiiruusya kwiiguru weetu kubha ekimweeso iguru wayo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Akakora ego, okubha ayeerye ekanisa kwo okuhitira engʼana ya Taatabhugya kwo obhubatiizo bhwa amaanzi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>abhone okuyireetera ekanisa enguungo, yino etana eriibhati naabhe ekomo naabhe gogoosi kya gayo, nawe ehoreeru yino etana isoro. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Ego niigo ekweenderwa abhasubhe okubhaseega abhakari bhaabhu kyeego emibhiri gyaabhu abheene. Omusubhe wuno aseegiri mukaaye yiiseegiri omweene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Atariho omuutu wuno akugubhiihirira omubhiri gwaaye omweene, nawe araguhaana ebhyaakurya no okugutuga bhwaheene, kyeego Krisito akuyituga ekanisa yaaye. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Etwe twoosi ni bhiimo bhyo omubhiri gwaaye. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Kyeego Amakaamo Amahoreeru gakubhuga, “Kwe ekigirirye kino, omusubhe aramutiga wiise na nina waabhu, aragwaatana na mukaaye, na abhabhiri bhano bharabha mubhiri gumwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="GEN 2:24">Obhweemero 2:24</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Embiso yiyo ni kuru, nawe enye niragaamba iguru wa Krisito ne ekanisa. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Kweego, emwe mwoosi mubhaseege abhakari bheenyu kyeego mukwiiseega mumitima gyeenyu, na abhakari bhareenderwa bhabhiigwe abhasubhe bhaabhu.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo kubhaana na abhiibhuri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Emwe abhaana, mubhiigwe abhiibhuri bheenyu kwo okubha mugwaateeni no Omukuru Yeesu, okukora ego niryo eriingʼana eriizomu. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>Taatabhugya hano yatuuriri obhuswaagyo bhwaaye, akataanga no obhurage bhuno bhukubhuga, “Mubhe murasuuka wuuso na nyoko weenyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>Kwo okukora ego, orabhona orubhaango no obhwiikari bhwaaru mukyaaro.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Rora <ref loc="EXO 20:12">Okurwa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Obhuhiiti bhwe Emigiro 5:16</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Emwe bhataata, mutabhazabhura abhaana bheenyu, nawe mubharere bhwaheene kwa amaragiriro go Omukuru Yeesu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ameegyo iguru ya abhakuru na abhabhagati bhaabhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Emwe abhagya, mubhiigwe abhakuru bheenyu, kwo okubhasuuka na kwe ekoro yimwe, kyeego mukumwiigwa Krisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Mutakora ego embere wa ameeso gaabhu abheene, okubha mwiikoombekoombe kweebho, nawe mukore emirimo kya abhagya bha Krisito. Mukore obhuseegi bhwa Taatabhugya kwe ekoro yimwe. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Mukore emirimo kwe ekoro yimwe, kyaabhurya muramukorera emirimo Omukuru Yeesu na etari kwo okukorera abhaatu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Mumenye kubha, Omukuru aramuha omuutu wuyo woosi esaambo kwa ryoryoosi eriizomu rino akoriri, kyeego ewe ni mugya kisya omuutu wuno ni mwiiragaanzi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Emwe abhakuru, mubhakorere abhagya bheenyu gayogayo. Mutabhakaanga, kwo okubha mumenyiri kubha emwe ni kye ebho, munawe Omukuru Yeesu wuyowuyo wuno ari mwiisaaro, neewe atana bhwaahuri.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ebhigwaato bhyo okumuhiza Seetaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Mubhuteero, mubhe abhakaari no okugumira kwo Omukuru Yeesu, no okubha no obhunagya ne eziinguru zyaaye. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Mwiibhohe ebhigwaato bhyoosi bhino Taatabhugya akubhaha, okubha munagye kwaanga omukoonyo gwa Seetaani. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Niragaamba ego kwo okubha, okuhizana kweetu kutari iguru wa abhaatu, nawe turahizana iguru ya amasaambwa amabhi mukyaaro kino kitakurorekana, ni iguru yo obhutemi no obhunagya, na iguru ya abhakuru bhe ekiirima.<verse eid="EPH 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Kweego, mwiibhohe ebhigwaato bhyoosi bhino Taatabhugya akubhaha, okubha munagye okwiiribhira orusiku rwo obhusarya runo rukuuza neemwe hano mukumara kukora goosi, mwiimeerere tiri. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Ambe, mwiibhanure kwe eriihi riyo obhuheene na bhubhe kyo omukena mukiribhizi, no okwiibhoha engubha ye eheene mukikubha, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>no omukya gwo okurwaaza Amangʼana Amazomu go omureembe, gubhe kye ebhikweera mumaguru geenyu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Hamwe na gayo goosi, obhwiikirirya bhubhe kye engubha mumabhoko geenyu, ebhasakirye okugirimya emibhwe gyo omuriro gwa Seetaani, omubhi wurya. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Musuungʼaane obhutuurya kyeego engohiira yeenyu ye ekyooma, ne engʼana ya Taatabhugya kyeego nyaambato yino muheerwe ne Ekoro Muhoreeru.<verse eid="EPH 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Eriibhaga ryoosi hano mukusabha Taatabhugya kumasabhi goosi, muteengeeze eriibhaga ryoosi eno murakaangatibhwa ne Ekoro Muhoreeru, mubhe murabhasabhira abhahoreeru bhoosi. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Munisabhire neenye woosi, okubha hano nikurwaaza Taatabhugya anihe amangʼana go okugaamba, ninagye okubhazweenia embiso ya Amangʼana Amazomu kwo obhukaari. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Enye neenye omwiimeerereri wa Amangʼana Amazomu ga Krisito Yeesu, gano gagirirye nibhe omubhohwa. Musabhe kubha nibhone okugarwaaza kwo obhukaari kyeego ekweenderwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amangʼana go okuraga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Omwiikirirya omurikyeetu omuseegwa Tikiko, kweeki omuhokya omuheene ku Mukuru, arabhazweenia amangʼana gaane goosi, okubha omenye kino nikukora. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Nimutumiri kweemwe okubha abhaganire amangʼana geetu no okubhatoongera eziikoro zyeenyu.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Omureembe gubhe kubhiikirirya abharikyeetu no obhuseegi hamwe no obhwiikirirya okurwa ku Taatabhugya Taata no Omukuru Yeesu Krisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Orubhaango rubhe kubhoosi bhano bhamuseegiri Omukuru weetu Yeesu Krisito kwo obhuseegi bhuno bhutakuhwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
